  "description": "The Shift R7 27.5\" is our new foray into All-Mountain riding with a modern geometry and 12-speed components at an affordable price tag. Featuring our new Shift R 140mm travel frame with our new 4-bar linkage design, up-to-date geometry and proprietary X6 aluminum tubing, the R7 model is equipped with the Sram SX 12-speed group featuring the new DUB Boost crankset, derailleur, shifter and wide ratio 11-50T cassette for easy climbing and crisp shifting. With 150mm of front suspension provided by a Rockshox Recon RL fork and a specifically-tuned X-Fusion air rear shock, the Shift R7 will satisfy a large variety of riding styles with its steeper seat tube angle for more efficient pedaling, slacker head tube angle (at 66 degrees) and longer reach for an improved attack position.\nNew MY20 X6 Alloy Shift R 4-Bar Linkage frame, 140mm rear travel, Boost thru-axle\nX-Fusion O2 Pro RL Trunnion rear shock w/ lockout\nRockshox Recon RL Boost fork, 150mm travel\nNew Sram SX DUB Boost crankset w/ 32T alloy chainring\nNew Sram SX 12-spd rear derailleur\nNew Sram SX 12-spd shifter & 11-50T Eagle cassette\nNew Kenda 27.5\"x2.4\" Regolith tires\nWeinmann U-28TL rims, tubeless compatible\nShimano Deore M400 disc brakes\nX-Fusion Manic 150 / 125mm internal dropper post & remote",
